.TH start-cli-disk-format 1  "format "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-disk\-format \- Erase a drive and format it as one Btrfs partition
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli disk format\fR [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIDISK\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Erase a drive and format it as one Btrfs partition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<LABEL>\fR
Filesystem label of at most 255 bytes (default: StartOS Backups)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIDISK\fR>
Drive to erase, e.g. /dev/sdb
